# ── Deliverables the patterns above would swallow ───────────
# "Data" (core.ignorecase=true on Windows) hides data/; "tests" hides ai/tests/.
# Both are handed to the other tracks: BE's stub mode reads ai/tests/fixtures/case{n}.json
# and FE renders data/documents/. Directory-only negations — __pycache__ stays ignored.
!ai/tests/
!data/

# ── Misc ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

docs
